# Byte-stable checkouts across platforms (s65 CI finding):
# the integrity suite parses file CONTENT (frontmatter, doc anchors,
# line counts); CRLF checkouts on Windows silently broke regexes
# anchored to bare \n. Pin LF for everything the suite reads.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Locked binary-ish formats — never normalize.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.jar binary
*.zip binary
*.woff2 binary
